From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:55:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Disable networking by default and remove bug report links

- Networking is now off by default; add --enable-networking to opt in.
  --disable-networking still works and takes precedence.
- Remove "report a bug", GitHub discussions/Discord and support email
  links from the problem report dialog (error details dialog is kept)
- Regenerate English translation keys for removed strings

Fork-Change: 03-no-network
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014r72Ms4f4YPmzcdb6AJxQK
